01:09:35.786 --> 01:09:37.412
and I can barely look you
in the eyes anymore.


01:09:39.748 --> 01:09:43.293
I can't concentrate in class.
I can't concentrate outside of class.


01:09:43.460 --> 01:09:45.336
Your son just...


01:09:45.504 --> 01:09:46.880
came and kicked
the ever-living shit out of me


01:09:47.047 --> 01:09:48.756
and I can't write anymore.


01:09:48.924 --> 01:09:53.511
So I'm just going to talk
for a minute.


01:09:53.679 --> 01:09:55.805
And you can just shut me up
whenever you feel like, okay?


01:09:55.973 --> 01:09:57.807
Go ahead, go ahead.


01:09:57.975 --> 01:10:00.643
All right,
so my friends...


01:10:03.355 --> 01:10:05.732
you know, the ones who were
pooling all their money together


01:10:05.900 --> 01:10:07.984
to pay for my tuition...


01:10:11.947 --> 01:10:14.699
that money that we
pulled together was dirty.


01:10:14.867 --> 01:10:17.368
All right.


01:10:17.536 --> 01:10:19.287
So what I'm basically
trying to tell you


01:10:19.455 --> 01:10:21.372
is that we started
an escort service


01:10:21.540 --> 01:10:23.750
that catered to your wife
and all of her friends.


01:10:23.918 --> 01:10:25.793
And I swear to God
I had no idea


01:10:25.961 --> 01:10:28.004
that it was your...


01:10:29.798 --> 01:10:31.966
that it was your wife.
And her friends


01:10:32.134 --> 01:10:34.802
were all just fuckin'...


01:10:34.970 --> 01:10:37.639
once this whole thing
started, man,


01:10:37.806 --> 01:10:42.644
I couldn't stop it.
I really really...


01:10:42.811 --> 01:10:44.270
it was going
just really well


01:10:44.438 --> 01:10:46.022
and then you came
and you told me


01:10:46.190 --> 01:10:48.816
that you got the school
to pay for my... my tuition


01:10:48.984 --> 01:10:50.818
and I felt awful.


01:10:52.655 --> 01:10:54.948
I just felt fuckin' awful.


01:10:55.115 --> 01:10:56.741
And I wanted to tell you about it,
but I couldn't.


01:10:56.909 --> 01:10:58.785
I didn't tell you about it,


01:10:58.953 --> 01:11:03.248
so then I went to the rental house
where we would,


01:11:03.415 --> 01:11:05.166
you know, do everything
and I tried to stop it.


01:11:05.334 --> 01:11:08.753
But I didn't stop it there because I
figured, "What the fuck?


01:11:08.921 --> 01:11:10.797
One night. One night.
One more time.


01:11:10.965 --> 01:11:14.884
Let's have one more time.
We'll go one more time."


01:11:15.052 --> 01:11:17.595
But it's not gonna be
one more time.


01:11:20.891 --> 01:11:23.893
Even if you hadn't caught us,
it wasn't gonna be one more time.


01:11:24.061 --> 01:11:25.478
And the only reason
you didn't catch me


01:11:25.646 --> 01:11:27.981
was 'cause I was out
alone with your...


01:11:28.148 --> 01:11:30.024
I was at your house...
your house!


01:11:30.192 --> 01:11:32.068
With your
fuckin' daughter.


01:11:35.990 --> 01:11:37.865
Post script: I had no idea
it was your daughter,


01:11:38.033 --> 01:11:40.076
but...


01:11:42.413 --> 01:11:44.289
I tried to come clean
with her.


01:11:44.456 --> 01:11:46.457
And...


01:11:49.545 --> 01:11:51.921
I don't know, man.
I'm just really fuckin' lost.


01:11:52.089 --> 01:11:53.965
And I know
that you're probably


01:11:54.133 --> 01:11:55.800
just super pissed


01:11:55.968 --> 01:11:58.011
and you don't care,


01:11:58.178 --> 01:12:00.054
but...


01:12:08.022 --> 01:12:10.606
Are you rolling a joint?


01:12:15.237 --> 01:12:16.988
I'm listening.


01:12:26.373 --> 01:12:28.249
You're not even mad?


01:12:28.417 --> 01:12:30.835
Kinda.


01:12:31.003 --> 01:12:32.670
Nah, not really.


01:12:32.838 --> 01:12:34.839
No.


01:12:36.925 --> 01:12:38.968
Come on, man.
I knew what was going on.


01:12:41.263 --> 01:12:43.639
You did?


01:12:43.807 --> 01:12:45.641
- You did?
- Well, of course I did.


01:12:45.809 --> 01:12:47.977
Find all your buddies
with a bunch of older women?


01:12:48.145 --> 01:12:50.355
And magical cash?


01:12:50.522 --> 01:12:53.691
I mean, I'm stupid,
but I'm not a fuckin' idiot.


01:12:55.069 --> 01:12:56.861
And you know what?
You said it.


01:12:57.029 --> 01:12:59.280
You didn't fuck my wife.


01:12:59.448 --> 01:13:02.200
You didn't know Courtney
was my daughter.


01:13:04.036 --> 01:13:06.579
And you did what you needed
to do to stay here.


01:13:06.747 --> 01:13:09.082
- So now what?
- Now what what?


01:13:09.249 --> 01:13:10.792
You gonna kick me
out of school?


01:13:10.959 --> 01:13:12.835
Nah.
Your friends?


01:13:13.003 --> 01:13:16.172
They took the heat for you.


01:13:18.050 --> 01:13:20.051
Anyway, you know what?


01:13:20.219 --> 01:13:22.095
You've been kicked out
of too many schools.


01:13:23.680 --> 01:13:25.348
So I told
the new headmaster that...


01:13:25.516 --> 01:13:27.892
Hang on. What do you mean
new headmaster?


01:13:28.060 --> 01:13:29.936
Oh yeah.


01:13:30.104 --> 01:13:32.397
I resigned this morning.


01:13:36.318 --> 01:13:38.569
The new headmaster
is English.


01:13:40.406 --> 01:13:43.241
I hear he wears bow ties.


01:13:45.077 --> 01:13:47.328
So,


01:13:47.496 --> 01:13:48.996
if you do stay here,


01:13:49.164 --> 01:13:50.706
your scholarship is safe.


01:13:50.874 --> 01:13:53.376
Look, man,
thank you, but...


01:13:58.048 --> 01:13:59.966
I have absolutely
no interest


01:14:00.134 --> 01:14:02.385
in staying here,


01:14:04.012 --> 01:14:06.681
I mean without you
or my friends, so...


01:14:06.849 --> 01:14:08.975
I figured as much.


01:14:19.111 --> 01:14:20.862
You know what?
You're gonna be all right.


01:14:21.029 --> 01:14:23.990
- I don't know about that.
- No, you're gonna be all right.


01:14:24.158 --> 01:14:26.033
I know.


01:14:26.201 --> 01:14:28.077
Really.


01:14:34.251 --> 01:14:36.043
So what are you gonna do
about your family?


01:14:37.379 --> 01:14:39.046
Well...


01:14:39.214 --> 01:14:42.842
that family...
my family's had problems


01:14:43.010 --> 01:14:45.344
for a long time
way before you came.


01:14:47.055 --> 01:14:48.806
And Judy and I, well,


01:14:48.974 --> 01:14:50.892
we were done years ago.


01:14:53.187 --> 01:14:54.729
Shawn.


01:14:54.897 --> 01:14:57.023
He's a troubled kid.


01:14:58.525 --> 01:15:01.068
I feel responsible
for all that trouble he has.


01:15:03.739 --> 01:15:06.157
But that's the gift
a father gives a son...


01:15:07.618 --> 01:15:09.577
resentment and scorn.


01:15:10.996 --> 01:15:12.455
He'll be all right.


01:15:12.623 --> 01:15:15.082
He'll come around
like when he's 29.


01:15:16.877 --> 01:15:19.420
And that little girl of mine?


01:15:19.588 --> 01:15:22.340
I don't worry
about her one bit.


01:15:22.508 --> 01:15:25.468
She has got it all, man.


01:15:25.636 --> 01:15:28.804
Got it all, that girl.


01:15:38.690 --> 01:15:40.608
- So what about you?
- Me?


01:15:44.071 --> 01:15:45.613
Well, me...


01:15:45.781 --> 01:15:47.865
can I ask you a question?


01:15:48.033 --> 01:15:49.534
Yeah.


01:15:49.701 --> 01:15:51.118
Seriously.


01:15:51.286 --> 01:15:53.496
You think I'm too old
to go back on the road?


01:15:53.664 --> 01:15:56.040
Nah.
Just wrap it up.


01:15:56.208 --> 01:15:58.334
Oh, I'm gonna
double-bag it.


01:15:58.502 --> 01:16:01.754
Oh yeah. I ain't
making that mistake again.


01:16:02.756 --> 01:16:05.007
Hey, do a bro
a solid, will you?


01:16:05.175 --> 01:16:06.259
Yeah, man.


01:16:06.426 --> 01:16:10.304
You take JetBlue
out of Ontario home tonight?


01:16:13.308 --> 01:16:14.809
Okay.


01:16:14.977 --> 01:16:16.727
Good.


01:16:18.021 --> 01:16:18.938
All right.


01:16:19.106 --> 01:16:20.982
Remember...


01:16:21.149 --> 01:16:24.235
heroes aren't born,


01:16:24.403 --> 01:16:26.404
they're cornered.


01:16:28.365 --> 01:16:30.783
- Bukowski?
- Mickey Rooney.


01:16:32.869 --> 01:16:34.537
Come on,
get out of here.


01:16:51.388 --> 01:16:53.222
That's good.


01:16:54.474 --> 01:16:57.018
I play so good
when I'm high.


01:17:15.037 --> 01:17:17.038
Excuse me. Sorry, man.


01:17:17.205 --> 01:17:19.123
Hi.


01:17:19.291 --> 01:17:22.585
- Hey, you need some help?
- Sam?


01:17:29.384 --> 01:17:31.135
Worst opening line ever.


01:17:36.224 --> 01:17:39.560
So what are you doing
taking my flight home?


01:17:39.728 --> 01:17:42.229
Your flight, huh?


01:17:42.397 --> 01:17:45.107
Well, if you must know,
I'm going to be living


01:17:45.275 --> 01:17:47.610
with my dad's parents
in The Village


01:17:47.778 --> 01:17:49.528
for the last year
and a half of high school.


01:17:49.696 --> 01:17:52.198
I hear they're eccentric
artists, so that's cool.


01:17:52.366 --> 01:17:54.408
That's cool.


01:17:56.244 --> 01:17:58.204
You really don't have
to help me with that. It's fine.


01:17:58.372 --> 01:18:01.540
Look, yes I do.


01:18:01.708 --> 01:18:04.752
By the way, how the hell do you plan
on getting all these bags past security?


01:18:04.920 --> 01:18:08.631
- I'm crafty.
- Crafty?


01:18:08.799 --> 01:18:10.800
If you'd like to ensure
safe passage of your bags,


01:18:10.967 --> 01:18:12.134
then maybe you should
let me take one.


01:18:12.302 --> 01:18:13.552
We can just say
we're together.


01:18:13.720 --> 01:18:15.221
Okay.


01:18:15.389 --> 01:18:17.390
It's cool.
It's my bag.


01:18:17.557 --> 01:18:21.435
Yeah, maybe, you know.


01:18:22.729 --> 01:18:24.438
Okay.


01:18:24.606 --> 01:18:26.315
- Okay.
- Maybe's okay.


01:18:33.365 --> 01:18:34.990
Thanks.


01:18:38.620 --> 01:18:41.789
- So...
- So...


01:18:43.709 --> 01:18:46.419
What's your
real story, Samuel?


01:18:54.511 --> 01:18:55.845
Got five hours to kill?


01:18:56.846 --> 01:19:36.846
